Facts used: I2C firmware protocol number, FIFO packing and depth, master command
opcodes, address/STOP_STRETCH fields, IRQ errors, cancel/abort completion, and
19.2-MHz source timing tables. The software GPIO host implements standard I2C
signaling through board-supplied open-drain pin operations.

The device repository supplies SM-T733 SE10 addresses, GPIO40/41 pin selection,
clock votes and MAX77816 register settings. No firmware or device-tree binary
is distributed in this module.
